      "diagnostic_note": "Offline MLD and published mlotst are not expected to agree exactly because published mlotst is based on the model top level and a displaced-parcel density test at local pressure, and is typically archived as a monthly mean of instantaneous MLDs, whereas the offline operator is computed from monthly mean thetao/so profiles using a sigma-threshold crossing depth interpolated between vertical levels. This commonly makes the offline estimate systematically shallower and can amplify disagreement in deep winter mixed-layer regions and frontal zones."
